[[31,63,0,"<h3 class=\"step\" data-step=\"removing\" data-part=\"removal\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/20.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Removing</h3><a class=\"jump\" href=\"#\" data-jump=\"refitting\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/21.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Refitting</a><p><a href=\"#/3025842\">7045A25</a></p><p><a href=\"#/3025855\">7045A84</a></p>"],[31,63,0,"<h3 class=\"step\" data-step=\"refitting\" data-part=\"refit\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/21.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Refitting</h3><a class=\"jump\" href=\"#\" data-jump=\"removing\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/20.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Removing</a><p><a href=\"#/3025855\">7045A84</a></p><p><a href=\"#/3025842\">7045A25</a></p>"],[31,63,2097152,"<h3 class=\"step\" data-step=\"removing\" data-part=\"removal\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/20.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Removing</h3><a class=\"jump\" href=\"#\" data-jump=\"refitting\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/21.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Refitting</a><p><a href=\"#/3025841\">7045A24</a></p><p><a href=\"#/3025842\">7045A25</a></p><p><a href=\"#/3025847\">7045A43</a></p><p><a href=\"#/3025848\">7045A44</a></p><p><a href=\"#/3025865\">7045A98</a></p><p><a href=\"#/3025855\">7045A84</a></p><p>1. Lift up the backrest upholstery until it is at the height of\nthe head restraint.</p><p>2. Release the retainers (2a) and extract the pins (2b) with the\nhead restraint and upholstery.</p><figure class=\"photo\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2048904.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure>"],[31,63,2097152,"<h3 class=\"step\" data-step=\"refitting\" data-part=\"refit\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/21.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Refitting</h3><a class=\"jump\" href=\"#\" data-jump=\"removing\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/20.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Removing</a><p>Check that the upholstery and head restraint\nare not damaged.</p><p>Place the upholstery and head restraint\nin position and attach the pins to the retainers.</p><p>Lower the upholstery along the backrest\nstructure.</p><p><a href=\"#/3025855\">7045A84</a></p><p><a href=\"#/3025865\">7045A98</a></p><p><a href=\"#/3025848\">7045A44</a></p><p><a href=\"#/3025847\">7045A43</a></p><p><a href=\"#/3025842\">7045A25</a></p><p><a href=\"#/3025841\">7045A24</a></p>"]]